From ac6f07d7008b1a70118cc85c4ccf89206262dab0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:15:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Admin Experimentation: reopen, and add version 2 for review

The section is visible again (flag no longer unreleased) and now has two
menu items, Feedback group v1 and v2, with a Version 1 | Version 2
switch on both pages so reviewers can compare.

v2 reads the same study and rules as "solve and win them":
- Wins: won (into the measure's healthy band) / improving / steady /
  worse / started healthy, per cohort with start-vs-now severity bands
  (ISI, GAD-7, PSS-10, PROMIS cut-points; WHO-5 50/28).
- This week: the study team's checklist (calls, missed questionnaires,
  due, low use, interviews).
- Engagement: per-participant weekly heat strip and WHO-5 change by
  sessions per week (association, not proof).

Rules in admin/data/study.ts with tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
